  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Walk to Local Eats & Bike Rentals | Indoor/Outdoor Gathering Spaces | Beach Supplies | Cookout Ready<br><br>Dreaming of relaxing pool days and warm sand between your toes? This newly updated Santa Rosa Beach vacation rental provides the perfect setting for your coastal escape! Map out your itinerary on one of the decks, then cool off with a swim or hit the waves at Blue Mountain Beach. Ready to recharge? Spark a friendly ping-pong tournament or settle in for a cozy movie night. Lock in your dates!<br><br>-- THE PROPERTY --<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br>- Bedroom 1: 1 king bed<br>- Bedroom 2: 1 king bed<br>- Bedroom 3: 1 king bed<br>- Bedroom 4: 2 twin bunk beds<br>- Loft: 1 queen daybed<br><br>LAKESIDE AT BLUE MOUNTAIN BEACH AMENITIES<br>- Outdoor pool (unheated)<br><br>OUTDOOR LIVING<br>- Furnished upper & lower decks<br>- Ping-pong table<br>- BBQ grill<br>- Beach chairs & toys<br><br>INDOOR LIVING<br>- Open-concept layout<br>- Modern furnishings & appliances<br>- 5 Smart TVs<br>- Furnished living area + loft<br>- 4-person dining table<br>- Ceiling fans<br><br>KITCHEN<br>- Refrigerator, microwave, stove/oven, dishwasher<br>- Cooking basics, dishware/flatware<br>- Drip & French press coffee makers (starter coffee provided)<br><br>ACCESSIBILITY<br>- 2-story home, 3 steps to enter<br>- 1 bedroom & bathroom on 1st floor<br><br>PARKING<br>- Garage/driveway parking<br><br>-- THE LOCATION --<br><br>- Prime location near dining, shopping & sandy shores<br>- Under 1 mile to Blue Mountain Beach<br>- 1 mile to Point Washington State Forest<br>- 6 miles to Topsail Hill Preserve State Park<br>- 9 miles to Grand Boulevard at Sandestin<br>- 10 miles to The Village of Baytowne Wharf<br>- 31 miles to Destin-Fort Walton Beach Airport, 36 miles to Northwest Florida Beaches Int’l Airport<br><br>-- REST EASY WITH US --<br><br>Evolve makes it easy to find and book properties you’ll never want to leave. You can relax knowing that our properties will always be ready for you and that we’ll answer the phone 24/7. Even better, if anything is off about your stay, we’ll make it right. You can count on our homes and our people to make you feel welcome — because we know what vacation means to you.<br><br>-- POLICIES --<br><br>- No smoking<br>- No pets allowed<br>- No events, parties, or large gatherings<br>- Additional fees and taxes may apply<br>- Photo ID may be required upon check-in<br>- Please observe quiet hours from 10:00 PM to 6:00 AM<br><br>ADDITIONAL INFORMATION<br>- This 2-story home requires 3 steps to enter. There is a bedroom and a full bathroom on the 1st floor",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
